From: Shiruba <koko0909e@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 05:09:03 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Animation sections, widget groups and texture frames

- WidgetAnimation::sections: named time ranges (with a loop flag) inside
  an animation. PlayAnimation / EvaluateAnimation accept a section name
  and play only that range.
- WidgetAsset::groups: named sets of widgets. A track whose widget is
  "@Group" animates every member; FindGroup / SetGroupVisible.
- UIImage frames / frame / framesPerSecond: a flipbook of textures (one
  path per line) drawn instead of texture, stepped by an animated frame
  or automatically. Frame textures count as dependencies.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
